        "raw": "[quote=\"Ameena\"]\n\nI think about the only time you  don&#39;t  get to apply a buff twice in the same power is with Mr Fixer&#39;s Dual Crowbars, where it specifies that the second hit has to be the same damage as the first, so it doesn&#39;t get buffed again.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYeah, crowbar&#39;s intent is to just turn his basic Strike of &quot;1 target 1 damage&quot; into &quot;2 targets 1 damage&quot;. Sacrosanct and Isothermic take in one instance of damage and output a second, so its slightly different.<br />&nbsp;\n",
